venv/
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.env
.streamlit/secrets.toml
.DS_Store
-----------
venv/ → Prevents the virtual environment from being uploaded.
__pycache__/ → Excludes unnecessary Python cache files.
.env → Prevents API keys and other secrets from being accidentally uploaded.
.streamlit/secrets.toml → Keeps Streamlit secrets, such as the VirusTotal API key, private.
*.pyc → Excludes compiled Python files.
